\section{Frozen hypothesis and isolated change}
\textbf{Hypothesis.} \VAR{summary.hypothesis|latex}

The parent Fusion v2 objective combines Student-\(t\) negative log likelihood
and a 0.20-weight quantile loss. This cycle adds only Smooth L1 location loss
with \(\beta=0.10\). A zero-weight control and weights 0.25, 0.50, and 1.00
share the same code revision, fold, seed, endpoints, architecture, raw
uncertainty, and sample caps. Heavy-tail probabilistic forecasting remains
useful for atmospheric extremes \cite{kamarthi2022camul}; the intervention
tests whether it needs explicit point pressure.

