This is a single-fold, single-seed objective screen. It cannot establish
seasonal robustness, transfer, or a champion. If one arm advances, it receives
the unchanged three-fold/three-seed protocol. If all three interventions fail,
the loss-weight family closes and the next cycle tests training-data scale
without reopening these weights.

